	"data": "Nextcloud — What's Relevant Going Forward\n\nResearch summary for cithoreal's self-hosted Nextcloud instance (cloud.cybernautics.net, v33 on Optiplex).\n\n🔑 The Big One: ExApp / AppAPI\n\nWhat it is: Nextcloud's new framework for building apps as external microservices (Docker containers) rather than PHP plugins baked into the Nextcloud codebase.\n\nWhy it matters for us:\nWrite Calcifer integrations in Python (not PHP) — same language as everything else we build\nThe ExApp runs as a Docker container on…",
